**14.2 Discretionary Reinstatement.** The Copyright Holder may, at its sole discretion, reinstate Your rights under this License by written notice, on such terms as the Copyright Holder deems appropriate, following any violation.

**14.3 Repeated or Willful Violations.** Section 14.1 does not apply to repeated violations of this License, or to any violation of Section 5 (Non-Commercial Restriction) that the Copyright Holder reasonably determines to be knowing, willful, or in bad faith. In such cases, reinstatement, if any, is solely within the discretion of the Copyright Holder under Section 14.2.

**14.4 Other Remedies Unaffected.** Nothing in this Section 14 limits any other legal or equitable remedy available to the Copyright Holder, including injunctive relief, for any violation of this License.

